{"id":"15467","play":".root.Q16.R14","mv":"R14","cat":"IDEAL","lb":"1","desc":"##Knight's Approach\n\nIf White is building towards an area of her own on, say, the right side, then White can attack the corner with this approach. (Other approaches are seldom preferable to this one.) (p. 14.)\n\n<A:O17> and **Tenuki** emphasize territory and sente. This makes them popular choices in modern Go.","marks":[{"label":"A","position":"O17"}],"see":["20276"],"tags":[],"next":[{"id":"15481","mv":"P14","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"15482","mv":"Q13","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"15468","mv":"P15","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"15484","mv":"S14","cat":"TRICK","lb":"_"},{"id":"15515","mv":"R16","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"15658","mv":"O17","cat":"IDEAL","lb":"1"},{"id":"17264","mv":"O16","cat":"IDEAL","lb":"5"},{"id":"17633","mv":"R15","cat":"IDEAL","lb":"3"},{"id":"20276","mv":"pass","cat":"IDEAL","lb":"_"},{"id":"15521","mv":"S15","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"20066","mv":"R11","cat":"GOOD","lb":"8"},{"id":"19220","mv":"Q10","cat":"IDEAL","lb":"4"},{"id":"19897","mv":"Q12","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"19961","mv":"N17","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"19541","mv":"Q11","cat":"GOOD","lb":"6"},{"id":"18747","mv":"Q14","cat":"GOOD","lb":"7"},{"id":"15589","mv":"R10","cat":"GOOD","lb":"_"},{"id":"17982","mv":"R12","cat":"IDEAL","lb":"2"}]}